#: crates/rustty-apprt/src/gtk/class/close_confirmation_dialog.rs:72
msgid "All terminal sessions in this tab will be terminated."
msgstr "이 탭의 모든 터미널 세션이 종료됩니다."

#: crates/rustty-apprt/src/gtk/class/close_confirmation_dialog.rs:73
